    `s 7(3.7)(b)(i) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft registered in Canada under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act`
    `s 7(3.7)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations`
    `s 7(3.7)(c) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen`
    `s 7(3.7)(d) the complainant is a Canadian citizen`
    `s 7(3.7)(e) the person who commits the act or omission is, after the commission thereof, present in Canada`

