    `s 7(3.72)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations`
    `s 7(3.72)(b)(iii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft operated for or on behalf of the Government of Canada`
    `s 7(3.72)(c)(i) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen`
    `s 7(3.72)(c)(ii) the person who commits the act or omission is not a citizen of any state and ordinarily resides in Canada`
    `s 7(3.72)(d) the person who commits the act or omission is, after the commission of the act or omission, present in Canada`
    `s 7(3.72)(e) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen`
    `s 7(3.72)(f) the act or omission is committed with intent to compel the Government of Canada or of a province to do or refrain from doing any act`
    `s 7(3.72)(g) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian government or public facility located outside Canada`

